; claude: the isometric kit (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_games3d.md,
; "Isometric: 3D worlds drawn in 2D"): a world seen from one fixed
; angle, drawn with two lines of arithmetic and a sort -- the trick
; Zaxxon invented in 1982 and Q*bert, Knight Lore, Populous and Diablo
; all use. Used by TinyZaxxon (a fortress flown over),
; TinyDiablo (a dungeon walked through) and TinySuperOffRoad (a
; stadium seen from the stands). In the package
; elm_playground_gamekits, as elm_playground_gamekits.kit_isometric.
(library
 (name kit_isometric)
 (public_name elm_playground_gamekits.kit_isometric)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries elm_playground)
)
